{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Clon War&quot; is a game in which you have to survive a fight against an influx of clones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How long can you survive? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Let's fight enemies and be strong</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is played in a roguelike genre, and as the stage progresses, the enemies become stronger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clearing the stage will give you a reward and you will grow too. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Let's dress ourselves up</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After the game, you can get the goods based on the results, which you can use when you visit the store. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let's decorate ourselves with individuality, not only the appearance of the character, but also accessories and effects.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Let's keep a record</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can check various records, such as the highest stage level and the number of enemies defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some records will appear on the leaderboard for others to see, so aim for high scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to manipulate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918600/extras/custom1.png?t=1738508660\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can click the ? icon at the top of the title screen to see how to operate it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Language Settings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918600/extras/custom2.png?t=1738508660\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can change the language in t